# The evidence is committed. `runs/` holds the attempts behind every reported
# number, and re-grading them under a repaired harness is free where regenerating
# them costs GPU money — so 3.2 MB of history buys back every measurement this
# project has paid for. It was ignored until 2026-09-11, which meant the raw
# evidence for a measured baseline lived in one container and died with it.
#
# summary.json is DERIVED and is re-derived by every fix that moves a number.
# summary.as-reported.json beside it is what was actually published, and is never
# rewritten: it is the pin that makes a moved number a visible diff.

# Derived views of the corpus; the corpus and its lock are the authority.
data/train.jsonl
data/holdout.jsonl
